<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
    <head>
        <%
        const date = new Date().toLocaleString("ja-JP", {
            year: "numeric",
            month: "2-digit",
            day: "2-digit",
            hour: "2-digit",
            minute: "2-digit",
            second: "2-digit"
        }).replaceAll("/", "").replaceAll(" ", "").replaceAll(":", "");
        %>
        <title>Patcher | Mamestagram</title>
        <%- include("link") %>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/patcher.css?<%= date %>" />
        <style>
            body::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
                background-color: #fdfdfd;
            }
            body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
                background-color: #3d3829;
            }

            header {
                background-color: transparent;
            }

            header .pc .patcher {
                color: #fdfdfd;
            }

            .animated {
                background-color: #ac8f39;
            }

            .animated .pc li:hover {
                background-color: #ffd966;
            }

            .animated .pc .patcher {
                border-bottom: 3px solid #ffd966;
            }

            @media (max-width: 1232px) {
                header {
                    background-color: #ac8f39;
                }
            }

            .mobile {
                background-color: #2a2822;
            }

            .mobile .patcher {
                background-color: rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.3);
                color: #fdfdfd;
            }

            .mobile .patcher span {
                border-left: 3px solid #ffd966;
            }

            .mobile li:hover {
                background-color: rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.3);
            }

            .mobile .register, .mobile .login, .mobile .avatar {
                background-color: #3d3829;
                color: #d1c27c;
            }
            .mobile .register:hover, .mobile .login:hover, .mobile .avatar:hover {
                background-color: #3d3829;
            }

            .link-form a, .link-form button {
                background-color: #ac8f39;
            }
            .link-form a:hover, .link-form button:hover {
                background-color: #debc54;
            }

            .search-form .searchbox {
                background-color: #464339;
            }

            .search-form .searchbox .txtbox {
                border-bottom: 2px solid #706b5c;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <%- include("header") %>
        <img class="banner" src="/image/banner/documents.jpg?<%= date %>" alt="" />
        <h1 class="pagename">Patcher</h1>
        <main>
            <div class="eng">
                <ul class="menu menu-en">
                    <li><a href="#overview-en">Overview</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#features-en">Features</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#download-en">Download</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#setup-en">How to use</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#faq-en">FAQ</a></li>
                </ul>
                <article>
                    <section id="overview-en" class="hero-section">
                        <h1>Mamestagram Patcher</h1>
                        <p class="lead">A lightweight launcher for relax play that brings back core gameplay feedback without touching your osu! client manually.</p>
                        <div class="summary-grid">
                            <div class="summary-card">
                                <h2>Single executable</h2>
                                <p>Run the patcher, let it launch osu!, and start playing without separate client edits.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="summary-card">
                                <h2>Gameplay feedback</h2>
                                <p>Restore relax misses and ranking panels so the play result feels closer to normal gameplay.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="summary-card">
                                <h2>Fast setup</h2>
                                <p>No installer flow, no file replacement, and no manual patching steps before each session.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section id="features-en" class="feature-section">
                        <h1>Features</h1>
                        <div class="feature-grid">
                            <div class="feature-card">
                                <h2>Enable Relax Misses</h2>
                                <p>Miss feedback appears again during relax play, which makes reading and failure states easier to understand.</p>
                                <img src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/88868436/585073004-a4160a34-10cb-458c-a9a0-fe751b5a751f.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..itYl-Ql-lxItZzBqom1itQSV8HWIBpQpTrl1_ezZVQU" alt="Relax misses preview" />
                            </div>
                            <div class="feature-card">
                                <h2>Show Relax Ranking Panels</h2>
                                <p>Ranking panels return after a map so the result screen keeps the familiar post-play flow.</p>
                                <img src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/88868436/585221940-406864b1-565c-4869-a702-50b48d281f3b.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..RVQoYEkIy2Cy3MdOhFlnGopUsGwrWV_A2et9HLU4CHU" alt="Ranking panel preview" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section id="download-en" class="download-section">
                        <h1>Download</h1>
                        <p>The patcher is distributed as a single executable and does not require manual client modification.</p>
                        <a class="download-button" href="https://github.com/mames1dev/mamesosu-patcher/releases/download/v1.0.2/mamesosu.patcher.exe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i>
                            Download Patcher
                        </a>
                        <p class="note">If your browser or security software asks for confirmation, review the file source first and continue only if it matches your expected download target.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section id="setup-en" class="steps-section">
                        <h1>How to use</h1>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Download the executable from the button above.</li>
                            <li>Run the patcher and wait for osu! to open.</li>
                            <li>Log in and play normally with relax enabled.</li>
                        </ol>
                    </section>

                    <section id="faq-en" class="faq-section">
                        <h1>FAQ</h1>
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                <h2>Does this replace osu! files?</h2>
                                <p>No manual file replacement is required for the intended flow.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <h2>Do I need to run it every time?</h2>
                                <p>Yes. Start your session through the patcher when you want the patched relax experience.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <h2>Can I keep using the normal client too?</h2>
                                <p>Yes. You can still launch your standard client separately whenever you do not need the patcher behavior.</p>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>
                </article>
                <a href="#" class="top">Back to top</a>
            </div>
        </main>
        <%- include("footer") %>
        <script src="/jquery/documents.js" nonce="<%= cspNonce %>" defer></script>
    </body>
</html>
